## 5. Results & Key Takeaways
* **3X Organic Traffic Growth:** Resolving foundational crawl issues (XML sitemaps) alongside Core Web Vitals fixes unlocked consistent ranking gains across 8+ global markets.
* **Higher AI & SERP Visibility:** Adding structured FAQs and clean keyword placement improved rich-result eligibility and brand citations in AI-generated answers.
* **Cross-Functional Efficiency:** Establishing a shared technical checklist between marketing and web development reduced turnaround time for page-speed and image-optimization fixes.
